#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current count of transfers in this company that are neither completed nor "
"cancelled, including drafts and return transfers. Counts transfer documents,"
" not units or stock value. Dashboard date filters are ignored for current "
"backlog."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah transfer saat ini dalam perusahaan ini yang belum selesai maupun "
"dibatalkan, termasuk draf dan retur. Menghitung dokumen transfer, bukan unit"
" atau nilai stok. Filter tanggal dasbor diabaikan untuk pekerjaan tertunda "
"saat ini."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current customer balances and overdue documents, net of credit notes, in "
"company currency. Current residuals only: no historical as-of balances, "
"installment ageing or cash forecast."
msgstr ""
"Saldo pelanggan saat ini dan dokumen lewat jatuh tempo, setelah nota kredit,"
" dalam mata uang perusahaan. Hanya sisa saat ini: tanpa saldo historis per "
"tanggal, umur cicilan, atau perkiraan kas."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
