msgstr "Tata letak saat ini"

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid "Current net customer balance"
msgstr "Saldo bersih pelanggan saat ini"

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current open and late transfers, plus completed transfer throughput by "
"selected completion period. Includes returns; counts documents, not units or"
" inventory value."
msgstr ""
"Transfer terbuka dan terlambat saat ini, serta jumlah transfer selesai "
"menurut periode penyelesaian yang dipilih. Termasuk retur; menghitung "
"dokumen, bukan unit atau nilai persediaan."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current open transfers with a scheduled date before the current instant. "
"Completed and cancelled transfers are excluded; drafts and returns are "
"included. Missing scheduled dates are excluded. Counts documents, not "
"quantities. Dashboard date filters are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Transfer terbuka saat ini dengan jadwal sebelum saat ini. Transfer selesai "
"dan dibatalkan dikecualikan; draf dan retur disertakan. Jadwal yang kosong "
"dikecualikan. Menghitung dokumen, bukan kuantitas. Filter tanggal dasbor "
"diabaikan."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid "Current overdue net balance"
msgstr "Saldo bersih lewat jatuh tempo saat ini"

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current signed residual of posted customer invoices and credit notes in "
"company currency. Customer credit notes reduce the balance; supplier bills "
"and drafts are excluded. This is the balance now, not a historical as-of "
"balance. Dashboard date filters do not change this current-balance metric."
msgstr ""
"Sisa bertanda saat ini dari faktur pelanggan dan nota kredit yang telah "
"dibukukan dalam mata uang perusahaan. Nota kredit pelanggan mengurangi "
"saldo; tagihan pemasok dan draf dikecualikan. Ini saldo sekarang, bukan "
"saldo historis per tanggal. Filter tanggal dasbor tidak mengubah metrik "
"saldo saat ini."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_board/lib/business_metrics.py:0
msgid ""
"Current signed residual of posted customer invoices and credit notes whose "
"document due date is before today in your timezone. Due customer credit "
"notes reduce this total. Uses document due date, not installment-level "
"ageing. This is current exposure, not historical as-of ageing; dashboard "
"date filters are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Sisa bertanda saat ini dari faktur pelanggan dan nota kredit yang dibukukan "
"dengan tanggal jatuh tempo dokumen sebelum hari ini dalam zona waktu Anda. "
"Nota kredit pelanggan yang jatuh tempo mengurangi total. Menggunakan jatuh "
"tempo dokumen, bukan umur per cicilan. Ini eksposur saat ini, bukan umur "
"historis per tanggal; filter tanggal dasbor diabaikan."

#. module: eh_board
#. odoo-python
